    "regime_notes": "Positive across 2020-2022 (IC 0.04530, ICIR 0.13722; 176 dates), 2023-2024 (IC 0.07939, ICIR 0.24576; 123 dates), and 2025-2026 (IC 0.01059, ICIR 0.03050; 122 dates). Recent regime is weaker and should be monitored.",
    "lookahead_control": "DXY shock gate is shifted one completed session; asset volatility uses a one-session lag; forward return begins after the signal date.",
